 as a functional target for retro-retinoids: a potential role in anhydroretinol-triggered cell death. <source>J. Cell Sci.</source> <volume>112</volume>:<fpage>2521</fpage>&#x02013;2528.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10393808</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib24"><citation citation-type="journal">Kruidering, M., B. van de Water, Y. Zhan, J.J. Baelde, E. de Heer, G.J. Mulder, J.L. Stevens, and J.F. Nagelkerke. <year>1998</year>. Cisplatin effects on F-actin and matrix proteins precede renal tubular cell detachment and apoptosis <italic>in vitro</italic>. <source>Cell Death Differ.</source> <volume>5</volume>:<fpage>601</fpage>&#x02013;614.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10200515</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib25"><citation citation-type="journal">Kuriyama, H., and H. Fukuda. <year>2002</year>. Developmental programmed cell death in plants. <source>Curr. Opin. Plant Biol.</source> <volume>5</volume>:<fpage>568</fpage>&#x02013;573.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12393021</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib26"><citation citation-type="journal">Kwiatkowski, D.J. <year>1999</year>. Functions of gelsolin: motility, signaling, apoptosis, cancer. <source>Curr. Opin. Cell Biol.</source> <volume>11</volume>:<fpage>103</fpage>&#x02013;108.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10047530</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib27"><citation citation-type="journal">Lam, E., N. Kato, and M. Lawton. <year>2001</year>. Programmed cell death, mitochondria and the plant hypersensitive response. <source>Nature.</source> <volume>411</volume>:<fpage>848</fpage>&#x02013;853.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11459068</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib28"><citation citation-type="journal">Levee, M.G., M.I. Dabrowska, J.L. Lelli Jr., and D.B. Hinshaw. <year>1996</year>. Actin polymerization and depolymerization during apoptosis in HL-60 cells. <source>Am. J. Physiol.</source> <volume>271</volume>:<fpage>C1981</fpage>&#x02013;C1992.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8997201</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib29"><citatio